# Examples

```
assert_eq!(0x1i32.overflowing_shl(4), (0x10, false));
assert_eq!(0x1i32.overflowing_shl(36), (0x10, true));
assert_eq!(0x10i32.overflowing_shl(31), (0, false));
```

